kers celebration and contemplation of the role Bach’s music plays in the world today. Blending historical reconstruction with very loosely linked ‘dramatic’ scenes and documentary sequences, the film constitutes a playful, painterly sequence of variations on the argument that Johann Sebastian changed the way the world hears thanks to his extraordinary ear for harmony.","language":"en-US"},"releaseDate":"2007-12-21","status":"Released","rating":6.8,"ratingCount":22,"genres":["Musica"],"countries":["Spain"],"facts":{"Runtime":"102m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":1330974,"name":"Christian Atanasiu","role":"Mayordomo"},{"id":20285,"name":"Féodor Atkine","role":"Vendedor de Pianos","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qCpSPJyM7v9p3fGBJV8ZqGETBr0.jpg"},{"id":3996284,"name":"Georg Christoph Biller","role":"Self"},{"id":1330968,"name":"Christian Brembeck","role":"J. S. Bach"},{"id":28514,"name":"Àlex Brendemühl","role":"Camioner","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/imQGzQ6HSoBVqfvIB0nLmhVmkNz.jpg"},{"id":1277742,"name":"Georgina Cardona","role":"Violonchelista"},{"id":1863029,"name":"Lucien Dekoster","role":"Afinador de Pianos"},{"id":1863030,"name":"Beatriz Ferrer-Salat","role":"Amazona"},{"id":1863031,"name":"José Pedro García Balada"},{"id":1863033,"name":"Gertrud Kossler","role":"Clienta"},{"id":1863034,"name":"Bert Kripstädt","role":"Camarero"},{"id":1863035,"name":"Lina Lambert","role":"Madre de Mendelssohn","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fRviDWAQnP95GMtk0oHDzTHHJL4.jpg"},{"id":1330969,"name":"Daniel Ligorio","role":"F. Mendelssohn"},{"id":1410725,"name":"Jordi Llordella","role":"Amigo de Mendelssohn"},{"id":1330972,"name":"Ferrán Ruiz","role":"Hijo de Bach"},{"id":1863037,"name":"Thomas Sauerteig","role":"Amigo de la Violonchelista","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5XN7YHYzNPcRpjfUY9XZfUsDh9G.jpg"},{"id":1863038,"name":"Franz Schuchart","role":"Guía Turístico"},{"id":2132854,"name":"Antonio Serrano","role":"Acompañante del Camionero"},{"id":1863039,"name":"Fanny Silvestre","role":"Anna Magdalena Bach"},{"id":1863040,"name":"Mariona Solanas","role":"Hija de Bach"},{"id":1863041,"name":"Àlvar Triay","role":"Camionero del Bar","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pv1DenlHCYsxH4UiAn93MSQAyoC.jpg"},{"id":1863042,"name":"Daniela Wick","role":"Descendiente de Bach"},{"id":1863043,"name":"Jens Wittwer","role":"Hijo Mayor de Bach"},{"id":1863044,"name":"Johannes Zametzer","role":"Carnicero"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"en-US","title":"The Silence Before Bach","overview":"A beautiful, sometimes faintly bonkers celebration and contemplation of the role Bach’s music plays in the world today. Blending historical reconstruction with very loosely linked ‘dramatic’ scenes and documentary sequences, the film constitutes a playful, painterly sequence of variations on the argument that Johann Sebastian changed the way the world hears thanks to his extraordinary ear for harmony."},{"language":"ca-CA","title":"El silenci abans de Bach","overview":"“El silenci abans de Bach” és una aproximació a la música i a les disciplines i oficis que l’envolten a través de l’obra de Johann Sebastian Bach, una mirada sobre les profundes relacions dramatúrgiques que existeixen entre imatge i música, de manera que aquesta darrera no es concep com un mer subratllat subsidiari de la imatge, sinó com a subjecte paritari de la narració. Així doncs, parteix d’una estructura musical prèvia. La banda sonora es nodreix d’obres de J.S. Bach, de dues sonates de Fèlix Mendelssohn i d’un estudi de Györg Ligeti, que creen una volta arquitectònica sota la qual transcorre la història de la pel·lícula. Una passejada pels segles XVIII, XIX i XXI de la mà de J.S. Bach.  \"El silenci abans de Bach\" conté algunes de les imatges més inspiradores del cinema dels últims anys: pianoles que ballen i cauen al mar, un concert de violoncel·listes en un vagó de metro en moviment, una desfilada de partitures en vista zenital... Tot un univers estètic i intel·lectual."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nv6tOTiYaRy8VEqkhr0kP14BvOD.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":94509,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ca-CA","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"ca":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"xx":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wCDNLbn2OVVZWFsxSgKtyeQnRB6.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wCDNLbn2OVVZWFsxSgKtyeQnRB6.jpg","language":"xx","width":1280,"height":1774},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wCDNLbn2OVVZWFsxSgKtyeQnRB6.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wCDNLbn2OVVZWFsxSgKtyeQnRB6.jpg","language":"xx","width":1280,"height":1774},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4wKEf8ng8ekNJQfCN43TmVUb7EL.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4wKEf8ng8ekNJQfCN43TmVUb7EL.jpg","language":"xx","width":600,"height":800}]}},"background":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"ca":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"xx":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]}},"logo":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"xx":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]}}},"seasons":{}},"tvdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tvdb","id":102197,"mediaType":"movie","series":{"source":"tvdb-web","sourceUrl":"https://www.thetvdb.com/movies/the-silence-before-bach","tvdbId":102197,"mediaType":"movie","tvdbMovieId":102197,"title":"The Silence Before Bach","originalLanguage":"en","poster":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/movies/102197/posters/102197.jpg"},"seasons":{}}},"metadataTasks":{"55ff9decc8b738ba2